    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i'm doing the water thing now but it's still stinging like crazy. i really don't want to go to the er if i don't have to, the wait is always so long and it's expensive. honestly even with the water it feels like the heat is still stuck in there. if i just put a thick layer of coconut oil or even some antibiotic ointment on it now, wouldn't that help seal it and stop the stinging? it seems like it would act as a barrier.",
